menu "TesserUI"

    config TESSERUI_NO_FILES_UI
        bool "Leave the file browser out of the web bundle"
        default n
        help
            The file browser's chunk (ui.widget "files") isn't served from
            flash: about 4.7 KB less. A page that draws one shows a readout.
            Same as defining TESSERUI_NO_FILES_UI.

    config TESSERUI_NO_EDITOR
        bool "Leave the text editor out of the web bundle"
        default n
        help
            The editor's chunk isn't served from flash: about 2.5 KB less.
            Edit buttons then close again at once. Same as defining
            TESSERUI_NO_EDITOR.

endmenu
